              <calculation class='tableau' formula='(IF DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;, [month wh (copia)_292734017822453762]) = [Parameters].[Parámetro 4]&#13;&#10;THEN [Target]&#13;&#10;END)' />
            </column>
